      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLIGHTS BOOKED (8) has a terrific record this track and trip with four wins and three placings from seven starts. Scored by 1.3 lengths last time (16.48) in a Grade 5 over 300m at this track. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. EXPEDITE (1) was narrowly beaten when placing two back but missed the frame latest finishing sixth (30.88) in a Restricted WIN at Q Parklands. Good beginner and aided by the inside draw. Well placed here and should do much better. SUPREME COMANDER (2) hit the ground running and was prominent throughout but faded out of it when 7th at Capalaba in a Restricted WIN. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Can measure up this time. SPRING DROP (7) has claims again if he runs up to the latest effort.",
